009018            ADD  1               TO   WS-IND-OUT
009019            ADD  1               TO   W-INDO
009020            ADD  1               TO   W-INDS-CONTATORE
009022          END-PERFORM
009024          ADD W-INDS-CONTATORE       TO   W-INDS-CONTATORE-TOT
009025        END-IF
009026        IF W-INDS-A-APP < W-INDS-A(W-INDX)
009028          COMPUTE W-INDS-D-APP =  W-INDS-A(W-INDX) - W-INDS-A-APP
